<h2 id="how-we-build-it">How we build it</h2>
<ul>
<li>Interview the five to ten people who use the numbers</li>
<li>Write one definition per metric, next to the query that computes it</li>
<li>Build the dashboard in Looker Studio, Power BI, Metabase or Tableau, whichever you have</li>
<li>Retire the reports nobody opened in the last ninety days</li>
</ul>
