ted" data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg>price tests, discount rules, gross margin</p><p class="mt-8 text-xl leading-relaxed" data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg>We estimate how demand responds to price for each product group, then set prices and discount limits from that.</p><div class="prose-orrery mt-8" data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg><p>Most price lists were set once and adjusted by feel. We use your order history to estimate how volume moves when price moves, then set prices where margin is highest without losing the customers you want to keep.</p>
